      "removeLiquidityImbalance(uint256[],uint256,uint256)"
    ],
    "withdrawalAccounting": "_calculateRemoveLiquidity computes feeAdjustedAmount = amount * (FEE_DENOMINATOR - calculateCurrentWithdrawFee(account)) / FEE_DENOMINATOR; each output is self.balances[i] * feeAdjustedAmount / totalSupply with truncating division. Withdrawal fee decays over four weeks using depositTimestamp and withdrawFeeMultiplier. LPToken._beforeTokenTransfer calls updateUserWithdrawFee on transfer, mint and burn. No current fee value is assumed from initial zero fees.",
